01:31:49.208 --> 01:31:50.708
Because I want to know the truth.


01:31:52.250 --> 01:31:54.125
And because the only way out is through.


01:31:55.458 --> 01:31:55.917
Robert Frost?


01:31:57.583 --> 01:31:57.917
Swamp thing.


01:32:02.042 --> 01:32:02.708
