01:37:17.333 --> 01:37:19.917
But why, why, why, why did I do that?


01:37:21.333 --> 01:37:23.125
Because you wanted me to know.


01:37:23.375 --> 01:37:24.667
The only reason I'm


01:37:24.750 --> 01:37:26.083
