01:38:17.125 --> 01:38:20.708
It is called drinking the-- anyone?


01:38:23.083 --> 01:38:23.375
Kool-Aid.


01:38:24.083 --> 01:38:26.500
It is true that I keep


01:38:26.583 --> 01:38:27.667
